			"notes": "Sky-Myce 2.8.0 for Minecraft 26.1.2 and Java 25.\\n\\nThis release expands the Greenhouses experience with plot-aware layouts, grouped crop shopping and seed crafting, mutation growth tracking, and clearer analyzer highlights. It also improves Goldor coordination by excluding players who are not in the current run's party, alongside related stability and usability fixes.\\n\\nDownload the standalone Fabric mod JAR below. Close Minecraft before replacing the mod, keep its Fabric dependencies installed, and open `/sm` to configure features. See the [player guide](https://github.com/cessna80808-star/Sky-Myce/blob/2.8.0/MANUAL.md)."
		},
