			"notes": "Sky-Myce 2.5.15 for Minecraft 26.1.2 and Java 25.\n\nThis release brings the custom menu renderer and navigation, Global Chat media and controls, dungeon camera and routing improvements, and stability fixes.\n\nDownload the standalone Fabric mod JAR below. Close Minecraft before replacing the mod, keep its Fabric dependencies installed, and open `/sm` to configure features. Local features work without Discord or a custom Loader; see the [player guide](https://github.com/cessna80808-star/Sky-Myce/blob/2.5.15/MANUAL.md)."
		},
